  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You still your body’s natural functions through the stillness of your mind.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Lengthen Flow<sup>MIM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as you have at least 1 point in your ki pool, the interval between taking damage or making saving throws you must make due to disease, poison, or bleed effects, is multiplied by your mythic tier (minimum x3). You multiply the amount of time you can hold your breath or go without food or water by the same amount. If you use an immediate action to delay the onset of bleed, disease, exhaustion, fatigue, nausea, or sickening, you delay its onset for a number of rounds equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc48\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
